---
title: Unusual Okta or Azure AD Privileged Role Grant Following Help Desk Activity
id: 6b8c9d1e-2f3a-4b5c-d4e5-7f8a9b0c1d05
status: experimental
description: Detects a privileged role assignment (Global Administrator, Super Admin) granted to an account that recently underwent a password reset or new device registration, consistent with escalation following a successful help desk impersonation call.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://www.huntress.com/threat-library/threat-actors/scattered-spider
tags:
    - attack.privilege_escalation
    - attack.t1098
logsource:
    category: application
    service: azuread
detection:
    selection_role_grant:
        OperationName: 'Add member to role'
        ModifiedRole|contains:
            - 'Global Administrator'
            - 'Privileged Role Administrator'
    selection_recent_reset:
        OperationName: 'Reset password (self-service or admin)'
    timeframe: 4h
    condition: selection_role_grant and selection_recent_reset
falsepositives:
    - Planned privileged onboarding that coincidentally follows a legitimate password reset
level: high

---
title: Unapproved Remote Access Tool Installed Post-Authentication
id: 6b8c9d1e-2f3a-4b5c-d4e5-7f8a9b0c1d06
status: experimental
description: Detects installation of AnyDesk, TeamViewer, or similar remote access software on a host shortly after a new or recently reset account authenticates, matching Scattered Spider's use of trusted tools for persistence.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1219/
tags:
    - attack.persistence
    - attack.t1219
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
detection:
    selection:
        Image|endswith:
            - '\AnyDesk.exe'
            - '\TeamViewer.exe'
            - '\ScreenConnect.exe'
    filter_approved:
        Image|startswith: 'C:\Program Files\ApprovedRMM\'  # replace with organization's sanctioned install path
    condition: selection and not filter_approved
falsepositives:
    - Legitimate IT support session using an approved but freshly-installed remote tool
level: medium

